1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:03,460
Right now, Earth is pulling on the Moon

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:06,945
with a force of two hundred quintillion Newtons.

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:11,240
That's roughly the thrust of ten trillion rocket

4
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:13,290
engines firing at full power.

5
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:17,158
And Earth has been pulling like that, nonstop,

6
00:00:17,332 --> 00:00:20,220
twenty-four hours a day, for four and a

7
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,540
half billion years.

8
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,550
Yet Earth doesn't burn a single drop of

9
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,050
fuel.

10
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,650
It doesn't plug into a wall.

11
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,670
It doesn't even lose mass.

12
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:31,670
Meanwhile, if you hold a heavy dumbbell out

13
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:34,250
at arm's length for just two minutes, your

14
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:37,590
muscles burn, your arm shakes, and you run

15
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,640
out of energy.

16
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:41,630
So how can gravity pull on the entire

17
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:45,250
universe forever without ever running out of fuel?

18
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:48,260
Doesn't that break the law of conservation of

19
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:48,500
energy?

20
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:53,080
No, and the real answer completely changes how

21
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,210
you see reality.

22
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:58,550
First, we'll separate two ideas our brains constantly

23
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,800
mix up: force and work.

24
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:04,030
Then, we'll see why a falling apple and

25
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:06,860
an orbiting Moon never create new energy.

26
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:11,310
And finally, we'll jump to Einstein's twist: that

27
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:14,313
gravity isn't even a pulling force at all.

28
00:01:15,013 --> 00:01:18,280
Our intuition gets tricked by our own bodies.

29
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,980
When you hold a heavy box still in

30
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:23,060
the air, you feel exhausted.

31
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:26,140
So your brain assumes that pushing or pulling

32
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:29,420
on something must always cost energy.

33
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:33,230
But look closer at what's happening inside your

34
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:33,460
arm.

35
00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:36,730
Human muscle fibers can't just lock into place

36
00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:37,660
like a steel beam.

37
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:41,580
To hold a weight steady, millions of microscopic

38
00:01:41,430 --> 00:01:46,200
protein filaments have to fire, release, and re-grab

39
00:01:46,050 --> 00:01:49,450
over and over again, dozens of times every

40
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,220
second.

41
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:54,400
Every single microscopic twitch burns chemical energy from

42
00:01:54,250 --> 00:01:56,900
your food and turns it into body heat.

43
00:01:57,220 --> 00:02:00,430
You aren't spending energy on the box; you're

44
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:03,630
spending energy just to keep your own biological

45
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,470
machinery contracted.

46
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:07,610
Now put that exact same box on a

47
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:08,870
wooden table.

48
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:11,610
The table pushes upward with the exact same

49
00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:13,270
force as your arm did.

50
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:15,227
It can hold that box up for a

51
00:02:15,168 --> 00:02:18,570
hundred years without eating lunch, without heating up,

52
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:22,170
and without burning a single Joule of energy.

53
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:25,230
That's our first big clue: applying a force

54
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,356
is completely free.

55
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:30,570
In physics, energy is only transferred when a

56
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:34,170
force actually moves something across a distance.

57
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:37,360
Scientists call that work, and the formula is

58
00:02:37,210 --> 00:02:43,270
beautifully simple: Work equals Force multiplied by Distance.

59
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:46,790
Multiply any force, no matter how gigantic, by

60
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:51,070
zero distance, and the answer is always zero.

61
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:53,770
Think of a magnet stuck to your refrigerator.

62
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:57,380
It pulls against gravity for decades without a

63
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:58,370
battery.

64
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,170
Why?

65
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:01,680
Because once the magnet snaps onto the steel

66
00:03:01,530 --> 00:03:03,570
door, nothing is moving.

67
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:06,870
The distance is zero, so the work done

68
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,540
is zero.

69
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,400
The exact same rule holds you in your

70
00:03:10,250 --> 00:03:11,370
chair right now.

71
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:14,300
Gravity pulls down on you, the chair pushes

72
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:16,390
back up with an equal force, and you

73
00:03:16,435 --> 00:03:17,550
don't move an inch.

74
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:21,750
Zero motion means zero work, which means Earth

75
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:25,070
spends zero energy keeping your feet on the

76
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:25,550
floor.

77
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,850
Wait a second, though.

78
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,940
What happens when you let go of an

79
00:03:29,790 --> 00:03:33,390
apple, and gravity actually does move it across

80
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:33,703
a distance?

81
00:03:34,403 --> 00:03:36,490
Drop an apple from a tree, and it

82
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:38,330
accelerates toward the ground.

83
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:42,090
Now it's moving across a distance, so gravity

84
00:03:41,940 --> 00:03:45,630
really is doing work, giving the apple kinetic

85
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:45,940
energy.

86
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:48,490
Where did that energy come from?

87
00:03:48,620 --> 00:03:50,610
It wasn't created by Earth.

88
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:54,000
It was borrowed from a cosmic bank account

89
00:03:53,850 --> 00:03:56,750
called gravitational potential energy.

90
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,850
Remember: the apple didn't teleport to the top

91
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:00,300
of the tree.

92
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:04,180
Something, sunlight powering the tree's growth, or your

93
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:06,470
own hand lifting the apple off the floor,

94
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:10,080
had to do work against gravity first to

95
00:04:09,930 --> 00:04:11,010
raise it up.

96
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:14,450
That work didn't disappear; it got stored inside

97
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:17,870
the gravitational field between the apple and the

98
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:21,580
Earth, like stretching a giant invisible rubber band.

99
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:24,330
When you let go, the rubber band simply

100
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:25,270
snaps back.

101
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:29,630
Stored potential energy converts smoothly into kinetic energy

102
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,150
of motion.

103
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:33,130
Earth didn't pay a single penny; it just

104
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:35,610
gave you back the exact energy that was

105
00:04:35,460 --> 00:04:36,600
deposited earlier.

106
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:39,470
If this way of seeing physics clicks with

107
